What is logged by the following code snippet?
```js
for (var i = 0; i < 3; i++) {
  setTimeout(() => console.log(i), 0);
}
```

Consider the code:
```js
function createCounters() {
  let count = 0;
  return {
    inc: () => ++count,
    dec: () => --count,
    get: () => count
  };
}
const c = createCounters();
c.inc();
c.inc();
c.dec();
console.log(c.get());
```
What is logged and why?
